      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"Template:NewIGFeature-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&lt;Introductory line taken directly from the FG&gt;</span></p><h2 id=\"Template:NewIGFeature-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">&lt;4-5 granular steps to implementing it. <strong>Each step should be accompanied with details, a screenshot and code snippets as required. </strong></span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">If a screenshot is not part of the OOTB Bahmni implementation, call it out as such.&gt;</span></p><h3 id=\"Template:NewIGFeature-1.ConfigureXYZTab\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Configure XYZ Tab</span></h3><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604195/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-10%20at%2010.55.06.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1447137552076&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=375\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32604195/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-10%20at%2010.55.06.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1447137552076&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604283\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-10 at 10.55.06.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32604195\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"48\" data-media-id=\"f5c6c1d6-4a6c-4c4d-9f41-81b541fbc784\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604195/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-10%20at%2010.55.06.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1447137552076&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=750 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32604195/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-10%20at%2010.55.06.png?version=2&amp;modificationDate=1447137552076&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=375 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Image resolution 700px. Image and Caption centered in Bold.</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Please refer to the code snippet below:<br/></span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5d36357b-dbd4-4515-b88e-170a9e304ecd\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">Please set Language to Javascript and linenumbers to true\nPlease remove all blank lines using this link http://textmechanic.com/Remove-Empty-Lines.html</pre>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"Template:NewIGFeature-KeyFields\"><span>Key Fields </span></h2><p><span>&lt;<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Any Key Fields. Highlight Mandatory Fields/Attributes with an asterisk. </span></span></p><p><span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iLn15MpxxTAnkzU_GS0ZR906bGZnGEzl2dicsilU0ak/edit#gid=0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Please add all key fields to the Glossary here</a></strong>&gt;</span></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><tabl